hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23036","Hushaym ibn Bashir narrated to us: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr informed us, on the authority of Atiyyah al-Qurazi, he said: I was presented to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) on the day of Qurayzah, and they doubted about me, so the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) ordered that they look at me whether I had grown pubic hair yet. They looked and did not find me grown, so he released me and joined me to the captives."
"23037","Sufyan narrated to us, on the authority of Abd al-Malik: He heard Atiyyah saying: I was, on the day Sad judged concerning them, a boy, and they did not find me grown pubic hair therein, and here I am now among you."
